{"unit_id":"tag:03PU:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。集合（sets）的层（sheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0002>是单射（injective）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>满射（surjective）），当且仅当茎（stalks）上的映射（map）\n<MATH_0003>\n是单射（injective）（相应地，<SPACE_0002>满射（surjective）），对于<MATH_0004>的所有几何点（geometric points）都是如此。<MATH_0005>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的序列（sequence）正合（exact），当且仅当它在所有茎（stalks）上都正合（exact），这里取<MATH_0006>的几何点（geometric points）处的茎。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
